  "commonAbsoluteSourceHeightsLn1571b147": "Absolute source heights: LN02. Elevated display: CHGeo2004 + HTRANS to the ETRS89 ellipsoid, used as a WGS84 approximation. Unknown line/area elevations are shown only as a ground marker at their first source vertex. Isolated point obstacles with an official AGL height are displayed at that exact height above the currently rendered terrain; their visualized absolute top may differ from the surveyed LN02 top. Extra KML label points on lines/polygons are not drawn as obstacles. Cable vertices matching published masts follow the same terrain-adjusted mast tops, with interpolated display corrections between supports. Other geometry retains source absolute elevations. Cable sag is not reconstructed; route checks use original source geometry.",
  "@commonAbsoluteSourceHeightsLn1571b147": {
