  "commonBevorzugteEbenenSindSchnellzugriffe2eb52776": "Preferred levels are quick access to existing layer controllers. A profile does not enable data source, location sharing, API connection, or automatic update. Source settings and permissions remain independent. Profiles do not store access data or personal locations.",
