  "commonDerKompassRichtetDie15ee98a3": "The compass directs the map to the north. \"My location is only looking for taps. Long press opens accuracy and tracking; map movements end the pursuit. The search accepts coordinates, places and roads.",
  "@commonDerKompassRichtetDie15ee98a3": {
