  "commonDieTagesuebersichtZeigtDie3e26c236": "The daily overview shows the highest published regional level. Altitudes, exposures and avalanche problems are described in the description when tapping. The colour does not apply to every slope.",
  "@commonDieTagesuebersichtZeigtDie3e26c236": {
