  "commonFpvmanagerCsvVTime07c740c7": "FPVManager CSV v1: time_s,airspeed_m_s,voltage_v,current_a (groundspeed_m_s is also accepted).\nEdgeTX: Date, Time, GSpd(kmh/km/h/m/s/kts), Curr(A), VFAS(V) or Bat(V).\nUse a single voltage and speed column. UTF-8, decimal dot, 2–20000 rows, up to 4 MiB, gaps ≤30 s. Missing measurements are rejected. See docs/preflight.md for an example.",
  "@commonFpvmanagerCsvVTime07c740c7": {
    "description": "Legacy key: FPVManager CSV v1: time_s,airspeed_m_s,voltage_v,current_a (groundspeed_m_s is also accepted).\nEdgeTX: Date, Time, GSpd(kmh/km/h/m/s/kts), Curr(A), VFAS(V) or Bat(V).\nUse a single voltage and speed column. UTF-8, decimal dot, 2–20000 rows, up to 4 MiB, gaps ≤30 s. Missing measurements are rejected. See docs/preflight.md for an example."
  },
  "commonFpvmanagerSpeichertPersoenlicheEintraegea3c540bd": "FPVManager stores personal records on the device. iOS can include them in device backups. Online tiles can reveal your location area when you center or follow. FOSSGIS logs route requests. Open-Meteo says it deletes logs after 90 days.",
  "@commonFpvmanagerSpeichertPersoenlicheEintraegea3c540bd": {
    "description": "Legacy key: FPVManager speichert persönliche Einträge auf dem Gerät. iOS kann sie in seine Gerätesicherung aufnehmen. Beim Zentrieren und Folgen können Online-Kacheln den Standortbereich erkennen lassen. FOSSGIS protokolliert Routenanfragen. Open-Meteo löscht seine Protokolle laut Anbieter nach 90 Tagen."
