  "commonHeightConversionChgeoHtranscc1a7473": "Height conversion: CHGeo2004 + HTRANS → ETRS89 ellipsoid (WGS84 approximation). For single Point obstacles with valid AGL, the rendered marker and height stem use local Cesium terrain + source AGL; the source top AMSL remains listed above and may differ. Cable vertices that match a unique published mast (within 2 m horizontally and 5 m in source top elevation) follow its displayed top; offsets between matched supports are interpolated. This is an approximate display correction, not surveyed cable geometry. Unmatched sections retain source heights. Route checks use original source elevations.",
  "@commonHeightConversionChgeoHtranscc1a7473": {
