  "commonKarteAnsichtBuendeltKarte719d6808": "\"Map & View\" bundles map, airspace, obstacles and OSINT. Satellite, topo and relief are background maps; streets, labels and saved spots can be switched independently. Labels show a limited selection of Swiss local and street names. Rare tools and metadata can be opened if necessary; current errors and data gaps remain visible.",
