  "commonKartenstartwerteGeltenBeimApp3fbf4f32": "Card start values are valid for the app start, activate or save the active profile. Later changes on the map remain until the next activation or restart. During ground view, simulation, navigation or paused renderer, start values are reset and applied only afterwards. Camera, selection, running control, forms and personal records are not reset when switching. Without profile, the current map is retained.",
