  "commonMeteoswissStationswerteSindMessungen2c9d236f": "MeteoSwiss station values are measurements at a single location; wind and gusts are in the source format km/h, precipitation as a sum of ten minutes. The measuring times are UTC and are additionally displayed locally. They do not describe a complete wind field and do not change the simulator wind. Missing quality flags remain unknown.",
