  },
  "commonWgsEllipsoidSchweizerLnc6e2dc07": "WGS84-Ellipsoid, Swiss LN02 and altitude over terrain (AGL) are different references. AGL refers to the terrain at the respective point, the starting height to the starting point. Unknown sources remain unknown. A flat replacement globe does not provide a measured terrain height.",
  "@commonWgsEllipsoidSchweizerLnc6e2dc07": {
